WEBVTT

00:16:27.761 --> 00:16:30.803
PM: Dhe duhet te bejme me shume perpara.

00:16:30.803 --> 00:16:32.004
SS: Shume me shume.

00:16:32.004 --> 00:16:33.234
PM: Faleminderit, Sheryl.

00:16:33.234 --> 00:16:34.468
Faleminderit qe bere perpara dhe qe the po.

00:16:34.468 --> 00:16:36.630
SS: Faleminderit.

00:16:36.630 --> 00:16:38.899
(duartrokitje)